  "changed_since_previous": "Now includes the complete patch showing the addition of the BIP-370 checkbox to SendConfirmationDialog, its plumbing into SendCoinsDialog and WalletModel::bumpFee, and constructor updates across wallet and test code.",
  "card": "Adds a checkbox to the GUI send and fee-bumping dialogs to toggle between exporting PSBTv0 and PSBTv2, defaulting to PSBTv0. This fixes hardware wallet and external signer incompatibility (issue #36518) where devices reject BIP-370 transactions. It also removes the default version parameter from the PartiallySignedTransaction constructor to require explicit version specification across call sites.",
